{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## LIVE VALIDATION — verify pass completes through the deployed MCP server\n\nCalled `review_plan` on `b928-3ab6-5985-417b` through https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/mcp\n(the deployed container, image `fd00707e7ed3`, which carries 2308 / `82b954b0c858` as an\nancestor). Subject ticket chosen because it is open and unblocked, so the gate could not\nfast-fail before reaching the verify stage — a fast-fail returns 'no error' and would prove\nnothing.\n\nResult fields that matter, against the values in the original report:\n\n| field | reported (broken) | this call |\n|---|---|---|\n| `verify_requests` | 0 | **1** |\n| `verify_error` | \"step 'review@then/prerequisite_verify' failed: This event loop is already running\" | **absent** |\n| `verify_failed` | true | **absent (not failed)** |\n| `indeterminate` | 4 findings | **0** |\n\nSupporting: `llm_ran: true`, `llm_calls: 4`, `llm_ms: 15884`, `verdict: PASS`,\n`signature.signed: true`, `source: attested`,\n`verified_at_sha: 2dbdcc8abe2c110543819d059a2b3bb63c82fb13`,\n`runner: pydantic_ai`, `model: bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6`,\n`region_source: REBAR_LLM_BEDROCK_REGION`.\n\nThe discriminator is `verify_requests > 0` together with `indeterminate: 0`, not the absence\nof an error string: the reported failure produced 4 indeterminate findings precisely because\nverification could not run to confirm or dismiss them. Those are now resolved, so the step did\nreal work rather than being skipped.\n\nNote for whoever picks up b928: this run's overlap pass surfaced\n`2a76-c9d9-4e8a-471b` as a likely DUPLICATE of it (confidence 0.82, shared artifact\n`src/rebar/_store/push.py`). Not acted on here."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-f